WEBVTT

NOTE TrailEye AI Best Of English captions

1
00:03.860 --> 00:06.400
Out here the forest never stops moving.

2
00:07.040 --> 00:10.180
Every trail, every ridge,
something is always passing through.

3
00:11.780 --> 00:16.300
So you pick your spots, you set your cameras,
and you let the wilderness do the rest.

4
00:23.690 --> 00:26.430
Weeks later you come back
with a handful of cards

5
00:26.430 --> 00:29.110
and thousands of photos
nobody has ever looked at.

6
00:31.150 --> 00:33.930
Somewhere in there is the animal
you waited all season for.

7
00:34.750 --> 00:38.730
Finding it used to cost you a whole evening.
Not anymore.

8
00:39.250 --> 00:42.770
TrailEye AI reads every single image
right here on your own laptop.

9
00:44.670 --> 00:48.850
You choose the folder, you press start,
and a whole season goes through in minutes.

10
00:50.650 --> 00:53.030
It finds every animal
and marks it in the frame.

11
00:53.030 --> 00:56.010
It tells you what it is
and how confident it is.

12
00:59.920 --> 01:03.780
Filter by species and jump straight
to the nights that actually matter.

13
01:05.480 --> 01:09.980
Every camera lands on the map,
so you can read your whole area at a glance.

14
01:11.640 --> 01:16.460
The heat map shows you where the activity
really is, not where you think it is.

15
01:20.440 --> 01:25.380
Rare visitors get a filter of their own,
so the sighting of the season never slips past you.

16
01:27.240 --> 01:31.620
When you are ready, export a spreadsheet
or a clean report you can hand to someone.

17
01:36.140 --> 01:37.900
And all of it runs on your own machine.

18
01:38.560 --> 01:40.120
Your photos never leave your computer.

19
01:41.620 --> 01:43.100
That is TrailEye AI.

20
01:43.480 --> 01:46.100
Let the cameras watch,
and let the AI find what matters.
